description:
Returns what the reader has noted about their reading in ReadingRate: their highlights and notes, insights ReadingRate generated about their reading, and the reading insights they saved, each with its id. Pass book_id for one book's notes, or insight_query to get the saved insights closest to a topic, from any book.

Use when the reader asks what they thought or noted about a book, for their highlights, what they concluded in an earlier discussion, or which saved insight to delete. To search the text of a book, use search_book_content.

Examples:
- {"book_id": "<book id>"}
- {"insight_query": "unreliable narrators"}
